config MP2_HELLO_HANG
	bool "Hang on purpose with interrupts locked (the watchdog trial)"
	help
	  Instead of counting five seconds and resetting through PSCI, print
	  the hang line and spin with interrupts locked. Neither the layer's
	  lifetime timer nor a PSCI reset can fire: only OP-TEE's SMC
	  watchdog (BL2 arms the IWDG, about 32 s) brings the board back.
	  Off by default; run it with tools/board-stm32mp2.sh run
	  --expect-watchdog.

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
